---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<article class="weather-card" data-weather-card aria-labelledby="weather-title" aria-busy="true">
  <header class="weather-heading">
    <div>
      <h2 id="weather-title" class="section-title">觀夕平台現在的天氣</h2>
      <p class="section-lead mt-4">
        不只報溫度：下方直接整理今天該怎麼穿、行程怎麼排、要帶什麼，以及海岸的浪況與潮汐。
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="weather-updated" data-weather-updated aria-live="polite">正在取得最新天氣…</p>
  </header>

  <div class="weather-shell">
    <div class="weather-loading" data-weather-loading>
      <span class="weather-loading-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div>
        <strong>天氣資料載入中</strong>
        <p>請稍候，正在整理安平海岸的最新預報與浪況。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="weather-content" data-weather-content hidden>
      <div class="weather-alerts" data-weather-alerts hidden>
        <h3>
          <span aria-hidden="true">⚠️</span>
          今天要先注意
        </h3>
        <ul data-weather-alert-list></ul>
      </div>

      <div class="weather-summary">
        <div class="weather-current">
          <span class="weather-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-weather-icon>🌤️</span>
          <div>
            <p class="weather-condition" data-weather-condition>--</p>
            <div class="weather-temperature">
              <strong data-weather-temperature>--°</strong>
              <span>體感 <b data-weather-apparent>--°</b></span>
            </div>
            <p class="weather-wind-line" data-weather-wind-line>風向與風速整理中</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="weather-summary-aside">
          <div class="weather-advice" data-weather-advice data-level="good">
            <span class="weather-advice-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <div>
              <strong data-weather-advice-title>取得行程提醒中</strong>
              <p data-weather-advice-text>請稍候。</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="weather-umbrella" data-weather-umbrella data-level="good">
            <span class="weather-umbrella-icon" aria-hidden="true">☂️</span>
            <div>
              <strong data-weather-umbrella-title>出門要不要帶傘</strong>
              <p data-weather-umbrella-text>請稍候。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="weather-guidance" aria-labelledby="weather-guidance-title">
        <div class="weather-guidance-head">
          <h3 id="weather-guidance-title">出門建議</h3>
          <p data-weather-summary-line>正在整理今天的建議…</p>
        </div>
        <div class="weather-guidance-grid" data-weather-guidance></div>
      </section>

      <section class="weather-ocean" data-weather-ocean hidden>
        <h3 class="weather-block-title">海岸與海象</h3>
        <dl class="weather-ocean-list" data-weather-ocean-list></dl>
        <p class="weather-ocean-note">
          浪況為模式推估，會隨天氣系統快速改變；現場浪況與告示優先。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="weather-tide" data-weather-tide hidden aria-labelledby="weather-tide-title">
        <div class="weather-tide-head">
          <div>
            <h3 id="weather-tide-title" class="weather-block-title">潮汐與沙灘安全邊界</h3>
            <p class="weather-tide-now" data-weather-tide-now>正在推估潮位變化…</p>
          </div>
          <span class="weather-tide-badge" data-weather-tide-badge hidden>--</span>
        </div>

        <dl class="weather-tide-facts" data-weather-tide-facts></dl>

        <figure class="weather-tide-figure">
          <svg
            class="weather-tide-chart"
            data-weather-tide-chart
            viewBox="0 0 320 132"
            role="img"
            aria-label="未來 24 小時潮位變化曲線"
          ></svg>
          <figcaption class="weather-tide-axis" data-weather-tide-axis></figcaption>
        </figure>

        <ul class="weather-tide-points" data-weather-tide-points></ul>

        <p class="weather-ocean-note">
          潮位為模式推估，實際時間可能因氣壓、風與地形而有數十分鐘落差；漲潮時浪線逼近堤防，請往平台內側移動。
        </p>
      </section>

      <dl class="weather-metrics">
        <div><dt>今日高／低</dt><dd data-weather-range>--°／--°</dd></div>
        <div><dt>最高降雨機率</dt><dd data-weather-rain>--%</dd></div>
        <div><dt>目前風速</dt><dd data-weather-wind>-- km/h</dd></div>
        <div><dt>今日最大陣風</dt><dd data-weather-gust>-- km/h</dd></div>
        <div><dt>今日日出</dt><dd data-weather-sunrise>--</dd></div>
        <div><dt>今日日落</dt><dd data-weather-sunset>--</dd></div>
        <div><dt>紫外線指數</dt><dd data-weather-uv>--</dd></div>
        <div><dt>相對濕度</dt><dd data-weather-humidity>--%</dd></div>
      </dl>

      <div class="weather-days-block">
        <h3 class="weather-days-title">未來七日預報</h3>
        <ul class="weather-days" data-weather-days aria-label="未來七日天氣預報"></ul>
      </div>

      <footer class="weather-footer">
        <p>上方建議由預報資料自動產生，並非官方氣象警特報。</p>
        <p>
          颱風、長浪與豪雨等警特報，請以
          <a href="https://www.cwa.gov.tw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中央氣象署</a>
          公告為準；現場告示與救生指示優先。
        </p>
      </footer>
    </div>

    <div class="weather-error" data-weather-error hidden>
      <span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="wave" class="size-6" /></span>
      <div>
        <strong>暫時無法取得天氣資料</strong>
        <p>
          請稍後重新整理，或直接查看
          <a href="https://www.cwa.gov.tw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中央氣象署</a>。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a class="weather-more" href="/best-time/">
    查看四季遊覽策略與時間建議
    <Icon name="arrow" class="size-4" />
  </a>
</article>

<script>
  interface WeatherDay {
    date: string;
    dateLabel: string;
    label: string;
    icon: string;
    condition: string;
    weatherCode: number;
    tag: string;
    maxTemperature: number;
    minTemperature: number;
    precipitationProbability: number;
    maxWindGust: number;
    uvIndex: number | null;
    sunrise: string | null;
    sunset: string | null;
  }

  interface GuidanceGroup {
    key: string;
    title: string;
    icon: string;
    items: string[];
  }

  interface TidePoint {
    time: string;
    height: number;
  }

  interface TideExtreme extends TidePoint {
    type: 'high' | 'low';
    index: number;
  }

  interface Tide {
    current: { time: string; height: number; trend: 'rising' | 'falling' | 'steady' };
    nextHigh: TidePoint | null;
    nextLow: TidePoint | null;
    highest: number;
    lowest: number;
    range: number;
    series: TidePoint[];
    points: TideExtreme[];
  }

  interface WeatherResponse {
    updatedAt: string;
    current: {
      icon: string;
      condition: string;
      weatherCode: number;
      isDay: boolean;
      temperature: number;
      apparentTemperature: number;
      humidity: number | null;
      precipitation: number | null;
      windSpeed: number;
      windGust: number | null;
      windDirection: string | null;
    };
    today: WeatherDay;
    daily: WeatherDay[];
    ocean: {
      waveHeight: number | null;
      wavePeriod: number | null;
      waveDirection: string | null;
      seaTemperature: number | null;
      tide: Tide | null;
    } | null;
    advice: {
      level: 'good' | 'watch' | 'avoid';
      title: string;
      text: string;
    };
    umbrella: {
      needed: boolean;
      level: 'good' | 'watch' | 'avoid';
      label: string;
      text: string;
    };
    guidance: {
      summary: string;
      severe: boolean;
      alerts: { title: string; text: string }[];
      groups: GuidanceGroup[];
    };
  }

  const uvLabel = (value: number): string => {
    if (value < 3) return '偏弱';
    if (value < 6) return '中等';
    if (value < 8) return '偏強';
    if (value < 11) return '很強';
    return '極強';
  };

  const createElement = <K extends keyof HTMLElementTagNameMap>(
    tag: K,
    className?: string,
    text?: string
  ): HTMLElementTagNameMap[K] => {
    const node = document.createElement(tag);
    if (className) node.className = className;
    if (text !== undefined) node.textContent = text;
    return node;
  };

  const SVG_NS = 'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';

  const svgNode = <K extends keyof SVGElementTagNameMap>(
    tag: K,
    attributes: Record<string, string>
  ): SVGElementTagNameMap[K] => {
    const node = document.createElementNS(SVG_NS, tag);
    for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(attributes)) node.setAttribute(key, value);
    return node;
  };

  const heightText = (value: number): string => `${value.toFixed(2)} 公尺`;

  const trendLabel = (trend: Tide['current']['trend']): string =>
    trend === 'rising' ? '漲潮中' : trend === 'falling' ? '退潮中' : '接近轉折';

  // 以逐時潮位畫出未來 24 小時的潮位曲線、滿乾潮標記與目前時間
  const renderTideChart = (svg: SVGElement, tide: Tide, gradientId: string) => {
    const { series, points } = tide;
    if (series.length < 2) return;

    const width = 320;
    const height = 132;
    const padX = 16;
    const padTop = 24;
    const padBottom = 26;

    const values = series.map((point) => point.height);
    const min = Math.min(...values);
    const max = Math.max(...values);
    const span = max - min || 0.5;

    const innerWidth = width - padX * 2;
    const innerHeight = height - padTop - padBottom;
    const step = innerWidth / (series.length - 1);

    const xAt = (index: number) => padX + step * index;
    const yAt = (value: number) => padTop + innerHeight * (1 - (value - min) / span);
    const baseY = height - padBottom;

    const coords = series.map((point, index) => ({ x: xAt(index), y: yAt(point.height) }));
    const line = coords
      .map((point, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'}${point.x.toFixed(1)} ${point.y.toFixed(1)}`)
      .join(' ');
    const area = `${line} L${coords[coords.length - 1].x.toFixed(1)} ${baseY.toFixed(1)} L${coords[0].x.toFixed(1)} ${baseY.toFixed(1)} Z`;

    const defs = svgNode('defs', {});
    const gradient = svgNode('linearGradient', {
      id: gradientId,
      x1: '0',
      y1: '0',
      x2: '0',
      y2: '1'
    });
    gradient.append(
      svgNode('stop', { offset: '0%', 'stop-color': '#2e6f73', 'stop-opacity': '0.4' }),
      svgNode('stop', { offset: '100%', 'stop-color': '#2e6f73', 'stop-opacity': '0.03' })
    );
    defs.append(gradient);

    const nodes: SVGElement[] = [defs];

    if (min < 0 && max > 0) {
      const zeroY = yAt(0);
      nodes.push(
        svgNode('line', {
          x1: String(padX),
          y1: zeroY.toFixed(1),
          x2: String(width - padX),
          y2: zeroY.toFixed(1),
          stroke: 'rgb(23 59 63 / 22%)',
          'stroke-width': '0.8',
          'stroke-dasharray': '3 3'
        })
      );
    }

    nodes.push(
      svgNode('path', { d: area, fill: `url(#${gradientId})`, stroke: 'none' }),
      svgNode('path', {
        d: line,
        fill: 'none',
        stroke: '#2e6f73',
        'stroke-width': '1.8',
        'stroke-linecap': 'round',
        'stroke-linejoin': 'round'
      })
    );

    // 現在時間的位置
    nodes.push(
      svgNode('line', {
        x1: padX.toFixed(1),
        y1: String(padTop - 8),
        x2: padX.toFixed(1),
        y2: String(baseY),
        stroke: 'rgb(233 138 74 / 60%)',
        'stroke-width': '0.8',
        'stroke-dasharray': '2 2'
      })
    );
    const nowLabel = svgNode('text', {
      x: padX.toFixed(1),
      y: String(padTop - 12),
      'text-anchor': 'start',
      'font-size': '8',
      'font-weight': '700',
      fill: 'rgb(214 111 42)'
    });
    nowLabel.textContent = '現在';
    nodes.push(nowLabel);
    nodes.push(
      svgNode('circle', {
        cx: padX.toFixed(1),
        cy: yAt(series[0].height).toFixed(1),
        r: '3',
        fill: '#173b3f'
      })
    );

    for (const point of points) {
      const index = point.index;
      if (index < 0 || index >= series.length) continue;

      const cx = xAt(index);
      const cy = yAt(point.height);
      const isHigh = point.type === 'high';

      nodes.push(
        svgNode('circle', {
          cx: cx.toFixed(1),
          cy: cy.toFixed(1),
          r: '2.6',
          fill: isHigh ? '#e98a4a' : '#2e6f73'
        })
      );

      const label = svgNode('text', {
        x: cx.toFixed(1),
        y: (isHigh ? cy - 6 : cy + 12).toFixed(1),
        'text-anchor': cx > width - padX - 22 ? 'end' : cx < padX + 22 ? 'start' : 'middle',
        'font-size': '8',
        'font-weight': '700',
        fill: isHigh ? 'rgb(168 72 47)' : 'rgb(46 111 115)'
      });
      label.textContent = `${isHigh ? '滿' : '乾'} ${point.time}`;
      nodes.push(label);
    }

    const ticks = [0, 6, 12, 18, 24].filter((index) => index < series.length);
    for (const index of ticks) {
      const label = svgNode('text', {
        x: xAt(index).toFixed(1),
        y: String(height - 6),
        'text-anchor': index === 0 ? 'start' : index >= series.length - 1 ? 'end' : 'middle',
        'font-size': '8',
        fill: 'rgb(23 59 63 / 45%)'
      });
      label.textContent = series[index].time;
      nodes.push(label);
    }

    svg.replaceChildren(...nodes);
  };

  let tideChartId = 0;

  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-weather-card]').forEach((card) => {
    const loading = card.querySelector('[data-weather-loading]');
    const content = card.querySelector('[data-weather-content]');
    const error = card.querySelector('[data-weather-error]');

    const setText = (selector: string, value: string) => {
      const element = card.querySelector(selector);
      if (element) element.textContent = value;
    };

    fetch('/api/weather', { headers: { Accept: 'application/json' } })
      .then((response) => {
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Weather request failed');
        return response.json();
      })
      .then((weather: WeatherResponse) => {
        const { current, today } = weather;

        setText('[data-weather-icon]', current.icon);
        setText('[data-weather-temperature]', `${Math.round(current.temperature)}°`);
        setText(
          '[data-weather-condition]',
          `${current.isDay !== false ? '日間' : '夜間'} · ${current.condition}`
        );
        setText('[data-weather-apparent]', `${Math.round(current.apparentTemperature)}°`);

        const windParts = [
          current.windDirection ? `${current.windDirection}風` : null,
          `${Math.round(current.windSpeed)} km/h`,
          current.windGust !== null ? `陣風 ${Math.round(current.windGust)} km/h` : null
        ].filter((part): part is string => Boolean(part));
        setText('[data-weather-wind-line]', windParts.join(' · '));

        setText(
          '[data-weather-range]',
          `${Math.round(today.maxTemperature)}°／${Math.round(today.minTemperature)}°`
        );
        setText('[data-weather-rain]', `${Math.round(today.precipitationProbability)}%`);
        setText('[data-weather-wind]', `${Math.round(current.windSpeed)} km/h`);
        setText('[data-weather-gust]', `${Math.round(today.maxWindGust)} km/h`);
        setText('[data-weather-sunrise]', today.sunrise ?? '--');
        setText('[data-weather-sunset]', today.sunset ?? '--');
        setText(
          '[data-weather-uv]',
          today.uvIndex === null ? '--' : `${Math.round(today.uvIndex)}（${uvLabel(today.uvIndex)}）`
        );
        setText(
          '[data-weather-humidity]',
          current.humidity === null ? '--%' : `${Math.round(current.humidity)}%`
        );

        setText('[data-weather-advice-title]', weather.advice.title);
        setText('[data-weather-advice-text]', weather.advice.text);
        const advice = card.querySelector('[data-weather-advice]');
        if (advice instanceof HTMLElement) advice.dataset.level = weather.advice.level;

        setText('[data-weather-umbrella-title]', `帶傘建議：${weather.umbrella.label}`);
        setText('[data-weather-umbrella-text]', weather.umbrella.text);
        const umbrella = card.querySelector('[data-weather-umbrella]');
        if (umbrella instanceof HTMLElement) umbrella.dataset.level = weather.umbrella.level;

        setText('[data-weather-summary-line]', weather.guidance.summary);

        const alertBox = card.querySelector('[data-weather-alerts]');
        const alertList = card.querySelector('[data-weather-alert-list]');
        if (
          weather.guidance.alerts.length > 0 &&
          alertBox instanceof HTMLElement &&
          alertList instanceof HTMLElement
        ) {
          alertList.replaceChildren(
            ...weather.guidance.alerts.map((alert) => {
              const item = createElement('li');
              item.append(
                createElement('strong', undefined, alert.title),
                createElement('span', undefined, alert.text)
              );
              return item;
            })
          );
          alertBox.hidden = false;
        }

        const guidanceGrid = card.querySelector('[data-weather-guidance]');
        if (guidanceGrid instanceof HTMLElement) {
          guidanceGrid.replaceChildren(
            ...weather.guidance.groups.map((group) => {
              const panel = createElement('article', `weather-guide-card weather-guide-${group.key}`);
              const heading = createElement('h4');
              const icon = createElement('span', 'weather-guide-icon', group.icon);
              icon.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
              heading.append(icon, document.createTextNode(group.title));

              const list = createElement('ul', 'weather-guide-list');
              list.append(...group.items.map((text) => createElement('li', undefined, text)));

              panel.append(heading, list);
              return panel;
            })
          );
        }

        const oceanData = weather.ocean;
        const oceanBox = card.querySelector('[data-weather-ocean]');
        const oceanList = card.querySelector('[data-weather-ocean-list]');
        if (oceanData && oceanBox instanceof HTMLElement && oceanList instanceof HTMLElement) {
          const rows: [string, string][] = [];
          if (oceanData.waveHeight !== null) {
            rows.push(['浪高', `${oceanData.waveHeight.toFixed(1)} 公尺`]);
          }
          if (oceanData.wavePeriod !== null) {
            rows.push(['浪週期', `${Math.round(oceanData.wavePeriod)} 秒`]);
          }
          if (oceanData.waveDirection) {
            rows.push(['浪向', `來自${oceanData.waveDirection}方`]);
          }
          if (oceanData.seaTemperature !== null) {
            rows.push(['海水溫度', `${Math.round(oceanData.seaTemperature)}°C`]);
          }

          if (rows.length > 0) {
            oceanList.replaceChildren(
              ...rows.map(([label, value]) => {
                const wrap = createElement('div');
                wrap.append(
                  createElement('dt', undefined, label),
                  createElement('dd', undefined, value)
                );
                return wrap;
              })
            );
            oceanBox.hidden = false;
          }
        }

        const tide = oceanData?.tide ?? null;
        const tideBox = card.querySelector('[data-weather-tide]');
        const tideFacts = card.querySelector('[data-weather-tide-facts]');
        const tidePoints = card.querySelector('[data-weather-tide-points]');
        const tideChart = card.querySelector('[data-weather-tide-chart]');
        const tideAxis = card.querySelector('[data-weather-tide-axis]');
        const tideBadge = card.querySelector('[data-weather-tide-badge]');

        if (tide && tideBox instanceof HTMLElement && tideFacts instanceof HTMLElement) {
          const trend = trendLabel(tide.current.trend);
          const facts: [string, string][] = [
            ['目前潮位', heightText(tide.current.height)],
            ['潮汐狀態', trend],
            [
              '下一次滿潮',
              tide.nextHigh
                ? `${tide.nextHigh.time} · ${heightText(tide.nextHigh.height)}`
                : '24 小時內無資料'
            ],
            [
              '下一次乾潮',
              tide.nextLow
                ? `${tide.nextLow.time} · ${heightText(tide.nextLow.height)}`
                : '24 小時內無資料'
            ],
            ['未來 24 小時潮差', heightText(tide.range)],
            [
              '沙灘空間',
              tide.current.trend === 'rising'
                ? '正在縮小，往平台內側移動'
                : tide.current.trend === 'falling'
                  ? '正在變大，仍遠離浪線'
                  : '變化趨緩，留意浪線位置'
            ]
          ];

          tideFacts.replaceChildren(
            ...facts.map(([label, value]) => {
              const wrap = createElement('div');
              wrap.append(
                createElement('dt', undefined, label),
                createElement('dd', undefined, value)
              );
              return wrap;
            })
          );

          setText(
            '[data-weather-tide-now]',
            `目前潮位約 ${heightText(tide.current.height)}，${trend}；漲潮時浪線會往堤防推進，退潮才露出大片乾沙。`
          );

          if (tideBadge instanceof HTMLElement) {
            tideBadge.textContent = trend;
            tideBadge.dataset.trend = tide.current.trend;
            tideBadge.hidden = false;
          }

          if (tidePoints instanceof HTMLElement) {
            tidePoints.replaceChildren(
              ...tide.points.map((point) => {
                const item = createElement(
                  'li',
                  `weather-tide-point weather-tide-point-${point.type}`
                );
                item.append(
                  createElement(
                    'strong',
                    undefined,
                    `${point.type === 'high' ? '滿潮' : '乾潮'} ${point.time}`
                  ),
                  createElement('span', undefined, heightText(point.height))
                );
                return item;
              })
            );
            tidePoints.hidden = tide.points.length === 0;
          }

          if (tideChart instanceof SVGElement) {
            tideChartId += 1;
            renderTideChart(tideChart, tide, `tide-gradient-${tideChartId}`);
          }

          if (tideAxis instanceof HTMLElement && tide.series.length > 1) {
            const first = tide.series[0];
            const last = tide.series[tide.series.length - 1];
            tideAxis.textContent = `曲線範圍：現在（${first.time}）→ 24 小時後（${last.time}）`;
          }

          tideBox.hidden = false;
        }

        const updated = new Date(weather.updatedAt);
        setText(
          '[data-weather-updated]',
          `更新於 ${new Intl.DateTimeFormat('zh-TW', {
            month: 'numeric',
            day: 'numeric',
            hour: '2-digit',
            minute: '2-digit',
            hour12: false
          }).format(updated)}`
        );

        const days = card.querySelector('[data-weather-days]');
        if (days instanceof HTMLUListElement) {
          days.replaceChildren(
            ...weather.daily.map((day) => {
              const item = document.createElement('li');
              const lead = createElement('div');
              const label = createElement('strong', undefined, `${day.label} ${day.dateLabel}`);
              const condition = createElement('span', undefined, `${day.icon} ${day.condition}`);
              const tag = createElement('em', 'weather-day-tag', day.tag);
              const values = createElement('div');
              const temperatures = createElement(
                'strong',
                undefined,
                `${Math.round(day.maxTemperature)}°／${Math.round(day.minTemperature)}°`
              );

              const notes = [`降雨 ${Math.round(day.precipitationProbability)}%`];
              if (day.maxWindGust >= 35) notes.push(`陣風 ${Math.round(day.maxWindGust)}`);
              if (day.sunset) notes.push(`日落 ${day.sunset}`);
              const rain = createElement('span', undefined, notes.join(' · '));

              lead.append(label, condition, tag);
              values.append(temperatures, rain);
              item.append(lead, values);
              return item;
            })
          );
        }

        if (loading instanceof HTMLElement) loading.hidden = true;
        if (error instanceof HTMLElement) error.hidden = true;
        if (content instanceof HTMLElement) content.hidden = false;
        card.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'false');
      })
      .catch(() => {
        if (loading instanceof HTMLElement) loading.hidden = true;
        if (content instanceof HTMLElement) content.hidden = true;
        if (error instanceof HTMLElement) error.hidden = false;
        setText('[data-weather-updated]', '資料暫時無法取得');
        card.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'false');
      });
  });
</script>
